[28.560000,"o","Dead reckoning estimates position from a known starting point.\nIt advances that position using measured speed, heading, and elapsed time.\nNavigators use it when landmarks or external fixes are unavailable.\nEach estimate accumulates error from drift, currents, wind, or instruments.\nRegular fixes are needed to correct the track and reduce uncertainty.\n"]
